{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992340/extras/8a4f9e15f055879c3edaf241e7cdcbb3.avif?t=1767741643\" width=462 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master Your Arrow</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've found a magical arrow that can be stopped in midair. Master its power to unlock new paths and traverse deeper into a world of evil.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992340/extras/ee398a1c83bc0b5b42f7ac15a3494ede.poster.avif?t=1767741643\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992340/extras/ee398a1c83bc0b5b42f7ac15a3494ede.webm?t=1767741643\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992340/extras/ee398a1c83bc0b5b42f7ac15a3494ede.mp4?t=1767741643\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defeat Enemies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face your enemies head on or expertly maneuver around them. Utilize creative angles and strategies to overcome the obstacles in your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992340/extras/4071d772987a13a0672d1c1f64351943.poster.avif?t=1767741643\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992340/extras/4071d772987a13a0672d1c1f64351943.webm?t=1767741643\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992340/extras/4071d772987a13a0672d1c1f64351943.mp4?t=1767741643\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Race Against The Clock</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get rewarded for traversing levels quickly! Collect Bronze/Silver/Gold/Diamond Medals for completing levels fast enough - unlocking bonus levels, cosmetics, and more! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992340/extras/28b4f052c1d07159b1064b1ffa1cd313.poster.avif?t=1767741643\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992340/extras/28b4f052c1d07159b1064b1ffa1cd313.webm?t=1767741643\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992340/extras/28b4f052c1d07159b1064b1ffa1cd313.mp4?t=1767741643\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3992340?t=1767741643","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3992340?t=1767741643","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992340/74722835bb93ec72b8c38d46f9cd8cfbe9b4c1bb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767741643","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992340/74722835bb93ec72b8c38d46f9cd8cfbe9b4c1bb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767741643","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span clas